Package: querencia-webhuelle
Architecture: all
Depends: querencia-schnatter (>= 0.3.0~)
Description: Querencia Web Wrapper, renamed to Schnatter (transitional package)
 Querencia Web Wrapper (German: Querencia Webhülle) was the wrapper for
 WhatsApp Web of Querencia Desktop in version 0.2.0. It is now called
 Schnatter (package querencia-schnatter). This transitional package brings
 Schnatter on upgrade; on its first start Schnatter takes over the sign-in
 and the settings by renaming the folders of the old name.
 .
 It keeps the starter of the old name (org.querencia.Webhuelle), hidden
 from the menus, which starts Schnatter, so panel launchers that still name
 it keep working.
 .
 It can be removed safely once no launcher refers to Querencia Web Wrapper
 any more.
